        <Summary>ISO 9660 image editor</Summary>
        <Description>ISO Master is an open-source, graphical program for editing ISO9660 image files. You can use it to extract files from an ISO, add files to an ISO and create bootable ISOs. It is based on the bkisofs library which provides the ISO9660 functionality.</Description>
        <Archive sha1sum="f761af2fa6c039d586ac893f67400608f08bdd3a" type="tarbz2">http://littlesvr.ca/isomaster/releases/isomaster-1.3.17.tar.bz2</Archive>
